  "VIX9D is not replicated from the stored chain: no stored Cboe candidate expiries on both sides of 9 days: the nearest pair 2026-12-04 (15.0d) / 2026-12-18 (29.0d) would extrapolate (near weight 1.429, outside [0, 1]), which is not Cboe's interpolation.",
